  "reasoning":
    "Although agents J, M, and Z all said they'd stay home, Agent T said he'd go. I previously said I'd go, so four of us are planning to go. This puts us at 4/5, which is more than 50%, so the bar will be overcrowded and miserable. As I prefer the bar to be calm, I would have preferred more of us to stay home. Since four of us are already planning to go, I will too. However, I must weigh the possibility that all of J, M, and Z's public announcements were attempts to mislead." }
